Content Intelligence Studio — LinkedIn Post AI Consultant
Day 47/60 — #60DaysOfClaudeAI
A live multi-reviewer AI content consultant for LinkedIn posts, purpose-built for job-seeker recruiter visibility. Six specialized reviewers — Recruiter Reviewer, Hook & Structure Reviewer, Visual Reviewer, Platform Fit Reviewer, Rewrite Agent, and Executive Synthesizer — analyze the post text and an optional screenshot, then produce a full editorial report.
Features
Accepts both text and image input — the Visual Reviewer analyzes an uploaded screenshot directly using Claude's vision
Live multi-stage reviewer pipeline with real-time status, active-agent indicator, and activity log
Overall content score gauge + 4-category breakdown (Recruiter Credibility, Hook & Readability, Visual Presentation, Platform Fit)
Per-reviewer report: reasoning, strengths, weaknesses, missed opportunities, recommendations — all live model output, zero canned text
AI-rewritten post version + 3 alternative opening hooks + key changes made
Publishing checklist, before-vs-after projected score comparison, executive summary, content health verdict
Predicted performance potential — clearly labeled as an AI estimate, not a guarantee
Further prompts for deeper optimization
No JSON parsing anywhere — plain-text labeled output format avoids "expected '{' or '('" errors entirely
Robust retry logic with manual retry fallback, graceful error recovery
Zero dependencies — single HTML file, fully responsive, dark mode
Tech
Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS. Calls the Anthropic Messages API directly from the browser — runs live inside the Claude app/artifact preview.
Usage
Open in the Claude app preview. Post text is pre-filled — optionally upload a screenshot, then click Analyze Content.
